            'indian_applicant_html' => '<h4 style=\'margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>What Your Sponsor Needs</h4><p>If joining a resident worker, your sponsor must already hold a valid Angolan residence permit. If joining an Angolan-citizen spouse, a different visa (the Temporary Stay Visa) applies.</p><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>What You Need to Provide</h4><ul><li>Marriage or birth certificate, legalized and translated, proving the family relationship</li><li>Valid passport and photographs</li><li>Criminal record certificate (for adult applicants)</li><li>Medical certificate</li></ul><p>Given the conflicting fee information found in our research, confirm current costs and the correct visa category (reunification vs. spouse-of-citizen) with SME or an Angolan consulate before applying.</p>',
            'seo_title' => 'Angola Family Reunification Visa for Indian Citizens',
