            'intro_html' => '<p>The Bahamas\' confirmed family-based route is the Resident Spouse Permit, which per the official Bahamas Immigration Department site covers foreign spouses of Bahamian citizens specifically — our research found no equivalent, clearly documented route for a spouse of a foreign (non-citizen) Bahamas resident. This is a distinct, in-country residence permission, not a short-stay family visit visa.</p>',
