            'indian_applicant_html' => '<h4 style=\'margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>If You Are Visiting Family in Cameroon</h4><p>You would use the short-stay visa covering family visits, applied for online via evisacam.cm and finalised with biometrics at the Embassy of Cameroon in New Delhi.</p><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Documents Typically Requested</h4><ul><li>Passport valid 6+ months</li><li>Legalised invitation/accommodation letter from your host in Cameroon</li><li>Proof of funds (bank statements, 3-6 months per differing sources)</li><li>Yellow fever vaccination certificate</li><li>Return ticket</li></ul><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>If You Are the Sponsor Seeking to Bring Dependents to Live With You</h4><p>You would need to already hold a valid Cameroonian work/residence permit before applying for dependent permits for your spouse and minor children -- this is a separate, in-country process from the short-stay visit visa.</p><p>Our consultants can help confirm current document lists and fees with the Cameroon Embassy in New Delhi before you apply.</p>',
